1.0.5 - 2026-11-21

[b]简体中文[/b]
[list]
[*]选择“自制反应堆”开局天赋时，开局直接获得并启用虚空电网。已有该天赋的存档也可启用电网，现有设备会接入电力网络。
[*]虚空存储、虚空水箱和虚空电网的制造配方会在满足各自解锁条件后开放。
[/list]

[b]English[/b]
[list]
[*]The Makeshift Reactor starting perk now grants and activates a Void Power Grid at the start. Existing saves with the perk can also unlock the network and connect an existing grid.
[*]Void Storage, Void Tank and Void Power Grid recipes become available once their respective unlock conditions are met.
[/list]

